{"3365820": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Palette Cleanser", "steam_appid": 3365820, "required_age": 0, "is_free": true, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A whimsical and lively garden somewhere in the distant future gets invaded by color-slurping aliens and ends up completely desaturated. The garden robot is on a mission to cleanse the aliens of their gluttony and restore the color palette. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br><i>Palette Cleanser is a sweet, compact 3D platformer lovingly crafted by students from Breda University of Applied Sciences over the course of eight months. </i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3365820/extras/ebf6152ff2d73338324fd8bee3ab1a20.avif?t=1757589018\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3365820/extras_big/ebf6152ff2d73338324fd8bee3ab1a20.avif?t=1757589018 width=800 height=80 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Swiftly dash and jump around the level controlling an adorable robot, cleansing critters along the way to keep your speed up and your spirits high! <br><br>                       <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3365820/extras/898d812f2d3698cc7d74cf54de55eecf.poster.avif?t=1757589018\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3365820/extras/898d812f2d3698cc7d74cf54de55eecf.webm?t=1757589018\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3365820/extras/898d812f2d3698cc7d74cf54de55eecf.mp4?t=1757589018\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3365820/extras/12d6fee6af766c06732238a038614c84.avif?t=1757589018\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3365820/extras_big/12d6fee6af766c06732238a038614c84.avif?t=1757589018 width=800 height=80 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >These cheeky little aliens think they've taken over, but not for long! Collect them and bring them to safety of their own silliness.  But watch out, some might fight back... </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >                       <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3365820/extras/10319235288308f29433af629c425cbe.poster.avif?t=1757589018\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3365820/extras/10319235288308f29433af629c425cbe.webm?t=1757589018\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3365820/extras/10319235288308f29433af629c425cbe.mp4?t=1757589018\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3365820/extras/8595df5f07de7a096004268eb371fb73.avif?t=1757589018\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3365820/extras_big/8595df5f07de7a096004268eb371fb73.avif?t=1757589018 width=800 height=80 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience a playful twist on size as a tiny robot exploring a HUGE garden! Wander in an open-ended environment and watch the world around you spring back to color as you progress! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >                       <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3365820/extras/f1cbcc183ce4fb57e5cd473f6d7960e9.poster.avif?t=1757589018\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3365820/extras/f1cbcc183ce4fb57e5cd473f6d7960e9.webm?t=1757589018\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3365820/extras/f1cbcc183ce4fb57e5cd473f6d7960e9.mp4?t=1757589018\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Anything else?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Well, the development team couldn't figure out if the player is: slurp &amp; sliding, dash &amp; riding, zip &amp; zapping, jump &amp; pumping, boot &amp; scooting, hop &amp; bopping, surf &amp; turfing, smooch &amp; smacking, blink &amp; skipping, boom &amp; zooming, Plink &amp; Plonk™-ing, but in any case you go very fast, so how about you just go and figure out and tell us later in the reviews.                             <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3365820/extras/b8e7890c03316002497b99fbab65ee1c.avif?t=1757589018\" width=285 height=228 /></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A whimsical and lively garden somewhere in the distant future gets invaded by color-slurping aliens and ends up completely desaturated. The garden robot is on a mission to cleanse the aliens of their gluttony and restore the color palette. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br><i>Palette Cleanser is a sweet, compact 3D platformer lovingly crafted by students from Breda University of Applied Sciences over the course of eight months. </i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3365820/extras/ebf6152ff2d73338324fd8bee3ab1a20.avif?t=1757589018\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3365820/extras_big/ebf6152ff2d73338324fd8bee3ab1a20.avif?t=1757589018 width=800 height=80 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Swiftly dash and jump around the level controlling an adorable robot, cleansing critters along the way to keep your speed up and your spirits high! <br><br>                       <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3365820/extras/898d812f2d3698cc7d74cf54de55eecf.poster.avif?t=1757589018\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3365820/extras/898d812f2d3698cc7d74cf54de55eecf.webm?t=1757589018\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3365820/extras/898d812f2d3698cc7d74cf54de55eecf.mp4?t=1757589018\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3365820/extras/12d6fee6af766c06732238a038614c84.avif?t=1757589018\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3365820/extras_big/12d6fee6af766c06732238a038614c84.avif?t=1757589018 width=800 height=80 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >These cheeky little aliens think they've taken over, but not for long! Collect them and bring them to safety of their own silliness.  But watch out, some might fight back... </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >                       <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3365820/extras/10319235288308f29433af629c425cbe.poster.avif?t=1757589018\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3365820/extras/10319235288308f29433af629c425cbe.webm?t=1757589018\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3365820/extras/10319235288308f29433af629c425cbe.mp4?t=1757589018\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3365820/extras/8595df5f07de7a096004268eb371fb73.avif?t=1757589018\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3365820/extras_big/8595df5f07de7a096004268eb371fb73.avif?t=1757589018 width=800 height=80 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience a playful twist on size as a tiny robot exploring a HUGE garden! Wander in an open-ended environment and watch the world around you spring back to color as you progress! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >                       <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3365820/extras/f1cbcc183ce4fb57e5cd473f6d7960e9.poster.avif?t=1757589018\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3365820/extras/f1cbcc183ce4fb57e5cd473f6d7960e9.webm?t=1757589018\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3365820/extras/f1cbcc183ce4fb57e5cd473f6d7960e9.mp4?t=1757589018\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Anything else?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Well, the development team couldn't figure out if the player is: slurp &amp; sliding, dash &amp; riding, zip &amp; zapping, jump &amp; pumping, boot &amp; scooting, hop &amp; bopping, surf &amp; turfing, smooch &amp; smacking, blink &amp; skipping, boom &amp; zooming, Plink &amp; Plonk™-ing, but in any case you go very fast, so how about you just go and figure out and tell us later in the reviews.                             <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3365820/extras/b8e7890c03316002497b99fbab65ee1c.avif?t=1757589018\" width=285 height=228 /></span></p>", "short_description": "Jump, dash and slide through a futuristic garden in Palette Cleanser, cute 3D platformer focused on smooth movement and an optimistic vibe! Control a tiny robot trying to restore the color palette of its garden. Capture the alien invaders to activate paint sprinklers and make the garden alive again.", "supported_languages": "English", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3365820/14625ec0349fe991369ef4e41007145431622a40/header.jpg?t=1757589018", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3365820/dc67c2fc1cd0c99590a4b02bd4e183cec39e02d8/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1757589018", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3365820/dc67c2fc1cd0c99590a4b02bd4e183cec39e02d8/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1757589018", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 11 64-bit<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5 @2.30 GHz or higher / AMD Ryzen 3 @3.00 GHz or higher<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Nvidia GTX 1060 3GB VRAM<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 12<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 2 GB available space</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 11 64-bit<br></li><li><strong>Proc